  "description": "The Kingbull Expedition is a retro-inspired, moped-style electric bike that combines classic motorcycle looks with everyday practicality. Its distinctive silhouette turns heads on city streets and brings a timeless feel to every ride.\nFront and rear suspension work together to absorb bumps and soften impacts, delivering a smoother, more comfortable ride across paved roads, gravel paths, and rough trails. Paired with wide 20 × 4-inch CST fat tires, the Expedition offers dependable traction and a confident feel across changing terrain.\nPowered by a 750W motor and a 31.5Ah battery, the Expedition delivers up to 120 miles of range for daily commutes and longer adventures. Pedal assist and throttle support offer flexible ways to ride, while actual range varies with rider weight, terrain, assist level, and riding conditions.\nFrom cruising through town to exploring new routes, the Kingbull Expedition combines retro motorcycle styling, full-suspension comfort, and long-range capability for every journey.",
